0014AEr 2  27 3B 27 20          .byte   "';' expected",0
0014B2r 2  65 78 70 65  
0014B6r 2  63 74 65 64  
0014BBr 2               err_expected_be:
0014BBr 2  27 42 45 47          .byte   "'BEGIN' expected",0
0014BFr 2  49 4E 27 20  
0014C3r 2  65 78 70 65  
